[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4015895227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117168#issuecomment-4015895227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117168","id":4015895227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vXbK7","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T07:57:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T07:57:20Z","body":"Just tested exporting this with better collada, and the DAE has the same issue, so It doesn't seem to be GLTF-specific.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4015895227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4016066288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117168#issuecomment-4016066288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117168","id":4016066288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vYE7w","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T09:15:56Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T09:57:54Z","body":"I haven't tested this is the source of your problem yet, but you will likely want to turn off vertex cache optimization (#86339) on import if you want nothing to be rearranged.\n\nSelect the file in the `FileSystem` tab, click the `Import` tab, and scroll down to `Meshes` and untick `Vertex Cache Optimization`.\n\n(This is available for DAE, I don't have a GLTF handy at the moment but I'm assuming it's the same.)\n\nUPDATE: It does appear to be the vertex cache optimization. GLB does have the checkbox, so turn it off for the file.\n\n_However_, for some reason, clicking \"reimport\" in the editor doesn't seem to cure it immediately, but if you delete your `.import` folder, then reload the project to force a re-import, it does get fixed.\n\nThe `import` button doesn't seem to do the job for some reason, will investigate why, that could well be a bug, or it's using some cached version. You shouldn't need to have to be deleting the `.import` folder manually for it to work. 🤔 \n\nEither way, it looks like it could do with a note in the docs / classref of this as a possible thing to watch for, as it is non-obvious.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4016066288/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4016129051","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117168#issuecomment-4016129051","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117168","id":4016129051,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vYUQb","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T09:53:27Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T10:05:19Z","body":"Ok on investigation the `re-import` button **is** doing the job, the imported file *is* changing immediately.\n\nIt looks like the IDE itself is showing the cached (previous) version of the model in the scene, and it isn't updating. But if you close the scene and reopen it, it **does** update.\n\nSo it's fairly easy to get around, but not good user experience. I'll see if it would be a good idea to get the editor to reload active scenes when `re-import` is clicked. The only thing is, it might be slow, maybe there is a way of only reloading affected resources. 🤔 \n\nEDIT: Seems this is a very common issue, even in Godot 4 (see e.g. #94334).\n\n### Default `vertex_cache_optimization` option\nI don't think we want to change the global default to this, as the discoverability is low and it offers a decent speed boost. An option might be to turn it off by default in meshes that contain alpha materials, but the logic might be pretty complex and bug prone, and would only be useful in a subset of meshes.\n\nSo for now I think just documenting the behaviour would be the best option here.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4016129051/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017923767","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117168#issuecomment-4017923767","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117168","id":4017923767,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vfKa3","user":{"login":"jitspoe","id":7751182,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3NTExODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7751182?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe","html_url":"https://github.com/jitspoe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jitspoe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-08T01:44:25Z","updated_at":"2026-03-08T01:44:25Z","body":"Thanks for the info!  I'm guessing this optimization was a newer feature?  I didn't seem to run into the issue in the past.  Maybe I just got lucky.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4017923767/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]